<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" xmlns:content="http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/content/"><channel><title>회귀 on 이어드림스쿨 6기 / AI 서비스 개발자 학습 블로그</title><link>https://gnl2109.github.io/tags/%ED%9A%8C%EA%B7%80/</link><description>Recent content in 회귀 on 이어드림스쿨 6기 / AI 서비스 개발자 학습 블로그</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>ko-kr</language><lastBuildDate>Mon, 06 Jul 2026 00:00:00 +0900</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://gnl2109.github.io/tags/%ED%9A%8C%EA%B7%80/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>[이어드림스쿨6기_2개월] 0706 데이터 회귀 모델 DecisionTreeRegressor Lv3</title><link>https://gnl2109.github.io/posts/month2-decision-tree-regressor-lv3/</link><pubDate>Mon, 06 Jul 2026 00:00:00 +0900</pubDate><guid>https://gnl2109.github.io/posts/month2-decision-tree-regressor-lv3/</guid><description>&lt;h1 id="데이터-회귀-모델-decisiontreeregressor-lv3"&gt;데이터 회귀 모델 DecisionTreeRegressor Lv3&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;이번 글에서는 Kaggle House Price 데이터를 사용해 &lt;strong&gt;주택 판매 가격(&lt;code&gt;SalePrice&lt;/code&gt;)&lt;/strong&gt; 을 예측하는 회귀 모델을 정리한다.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Lv1과 비교했을 때 Lv3에서 중요하게 추가된 내용은 다음과 같다.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;일부 독립변수 선택&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;파생변수 생성&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;바이닝&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;전처리 함수화&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;code&gt;DecisionTreeRegressor&lt;/code&gt; 하이퍼파라미터 설정&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;code&gt;KFold&lt;/code&gt;와 &lt;code&gt;cross_validate&lt;/code&gt;를 활용한 교차검증&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;실제값과 예측값 비교 시각화&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;특성 중요도 확인&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;탐색적 분석(EDA)은 생략하고, 의사결정나무 회귀 모델 하나만 사용한다.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h2 id="환경설정"&gt;환경설정&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;-webkit-text-size-adjust:none;"&gt;&lt;code class="language-python" data-lang="python"&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#75715e"&gt;# 기본 및 데이터 처리 라이브러리&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;import&lt;/span&gt; warnings
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;from&lt;/span&gt; pathlib &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;import&lt;/span&gt; Path
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;import&lt;/span&gt; numpy &lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;as&lt;/span&gt; np
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;import&lt;/span&gt; pandas &lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;as&lt;/span&gt; pd
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;from&lt;/span&gt; scipy &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;import&lt;/span&gt; stats
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#75715e"&gt;# 시각화 라이브러리&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;import&lt;/span&gt; matplotlib.pyplot &lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;as&lt;/span&gt; plt
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;import&lt;/span&gt; matplotlib.patches &lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;as&lt;/span&gt; mpatches
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;import&lt;/span&gt; matplotlib.ticker &lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;as&lt;/span&gt; mticker
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;import&lt;/span&gt; matplotlib.font_manager &lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;as&lt;/span&gt; fm
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;import&lt;/span&gt; seaborn &lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;as&lt;/span&gt; sns
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#75715e"&gt;# 데이터 분할 및 교차검증 도구&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;from&lt;/span&gt; sklearn.model_selection &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;import&lt;/span&gt; KFold, cross_validate, train_test_split
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#75715e"&gt;# 결측치 처리 도구&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;from&lt;/span&gt; sklearn.impute &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;import&lt;/span&gt; SimpleImputer
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#75715e"&gt;# 데이터 스케일링 및 인코딩 도구&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;from&lt;/span&gt; sklearn.preprocessing &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;import&lt;/span&gt; OneHotEncoder, StandardScaler
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#75715e"&gt;# 컬럼별 전처리와 파이프라인 도구&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;from&lt;/span&gt; sklearn.compose &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;import&lt;/span&gt; ColumnTransformer
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;from&lt;/span&gt; sklearn.pipeline &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;import&lt;/span&gt; Pipeline
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#75715e"&gt;# 의사결정나무 회귀 모델&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;from&lt;/span&gt; sklearn.tree &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;import&lt;/span&gt; DecisionTreeRegressor
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#75715e"&gt;# 회귀 성능 평가 지표&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;from&lt;/span&gt; sklearn.metrics &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;import&lt;/span&gt; mean_absolute_error, mean_squared_error, r2_score
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#75715e"&gt;# 경고 메시지 숨김&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;warnings&lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;filterwarnings(&lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;&amp;#34;ignore&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;)
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#75715e"&gt;# 랜덤 시드 고정&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;RANDOM_STATE &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#ae81ff"&gt;42&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;np&lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;random&lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;seed(RANDOM_STATE)
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h2 id="새로-학습한-머신러닝-도구"&gt;새로 학습한 머신러닝 도구&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;이번 노트북에서 새롭게 봐야 할 머신러닝 도구는 &lt;code&gt;KFold&lt;/code&gt;와 &lt;code&gt;cross_validate&lt;/code&gt;다.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>[이어드림스쿨6기_2개월] 0702 데이터 회귀 모델 DecisionTreeRegressor Lv1</title><link>https://gnl2109.github.io/posts/month2-decision-tree-regressor-lv1/</link><pubDate>Thu, 02 Jul 2026 00:00:00 +0900</pubDate><guid>https://gnl2109.github.io/posts/month2-decision-tree-regressor-lv1/</guid><description>&lt;h1 id="데이터-회귀-모델-decisiontreeregressor-lv1"&gt;데이터 회귀 모델 DecisionTreeRegressor Lv1&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;이번 글에서는 seaborn의 &lt;code&gt;tips&lt;/code&gt; 데이터를 사용해 &lt;strong&gt;팁 금액(&lt;code&gt;tip&lt;/code&gt;)&lt;/strong&gt; 을 예측하는 간단한 회귀 모델을 정리한다.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;사용한 구성은 다음과 같다.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;독립변수 X&lt;/strong&gt;: &lt;code&gt;total_bill&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;size&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;종속변수 y&lt;/strong&gt;: &lt;code&gt;tip&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;모델 구성&lt;/strong&gt;: &lt;code&gt;Pipeline&lt;/code&gt; = &lt;code&gt;StandardScaler&lt;/code&gt; + &lt;code&gt;DecisionTreeRegressor&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;분류 모델이 &lt;code&gt;생존/사망&lt;/code&gt;처럼 정해진 범주를 예측한다면, 회귀 모델은 팁 금액처럼 연속적인 숫자 값을 예측한다.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h2 id="머신러닝-데이터-분석-단계"&gt;머신러닝 데이터 분석 단계&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;머신러닝 모델을 만드는 기본 흐름은 다음과 같다.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;데이터 수집&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;불필요한 데이터 제거, 결측치 처리 등 전처리&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;훈련 데이터와 테스트 데이터 분리&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;사용할 모델 선정&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;모델과 훈련 데이터를 활용해 학습&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;학습된 모델에 테스트 데이터 적용&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;예측값과 실제값을 비교해 평가지표 산출&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;모델 성능을 해석하고 개선 방향 검토&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;p&gt;이번 예제에서는 이 흐름을 &lt;code&gt;tips&lt;/code&gt; 데이터와 &lt;code&gt;DecisionTreeRegressor&lt;/code&gt;로 실습한다.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>